name:           lithon-vk
version:        0.1.0.0
synopsis:       Alternative Vulkan bindings for Haskell
description:    A modern (Vulkan 1.3+), curated Vulkan binding: type-level-friendly enums
                with open decoding, phantom-typed flag sets, sType/pNext chains over
                sop-core, arena-based marshalling, and never-throwing result plumbing.
                Everything under @src@ is generated by lithon-codegen from the pinned
                Vulkan registry — do not edit by hand; see the repository README.
